# Autonomous Ops Policy

- Use autonomous fixing only for low-risk, bounded changes.
- Never auto-apply high-risk fixes in auth, billing, DB, migration, or deploy-critical files.
- Require PR-based delivery for all autonomous fixes; never direct-push risky logic.
- If risk is medium/high, auto-open an issue with context and request human review.
- Keep `docs/AUTONOMOUS_AUTOFIX_POLICY.md` aligned with workflow guardrails and risk logic.
